ambushed when the group gets inside the  base they find several men either dead  or severely injured the pastor also  reveals that one of the men is missing  and hearing this miles tells everyone to  leave the place immediately he believes  that the militia is interrogating their  man and it is only a matter of time  before their location is compromised  Nora agrees but asks for 30 minutes as  they have to patch up the wounded man  unfortunately their decision turns out  to be fatal as after just a few minutes  the militia led by Captain Adam shows up  to buy them some some time miles orders  their best shooter to head upstairs with  the sniper the plan works as the guy  starts taking down several of the  malicious men forcing them to retreat  the standoff lasts so long that it has  now become night inside the base miles  and the group are trying to make a  tunnel through the wall so that they can  get to the other side however their plan  fails miserably when the wall becomes  loose and falls into the hole they just  dug hence destroying their hard work at  the same time the sniper on the roof  also gets killed soon Captain Adam and  his men barge into the base but miles  busting out those badass sword shops  again brings down some of the men and  takes Adam hostage he then ties him up  in a room and starts thinking of a way  out surprisingly Adam recognizes miles  leaving everyone in the room shocked  Charlie asks how they could know each  other and in a shocking turn of events  Adam reveals that Miles was the former  right-hand man of General Monroe in fact  he is the one who trained the entire  militia and that is why they are so  deadly but despite the Revelation miles  is focused on getting them out he  proposes a deal in which he will  surrender himself to the Monroe militia  and in exchange his group will be left  unharmed for some reason Adam accepts  probably because he's lying and soon  miles is taken away a flashback then  shows that two weeks After the Blackout  miles left for Chicago in search of his  brother and his best friend Monroe also  followed him along the way they came  across two men severely beating up a man  being the nice guy that he is Miles  approaches them takes out his gun and  shoots them dead after this the two  friends helped the victim up who is  revealed to be none other than Captain  Adam this is why he respects miles  despite their current indifferences back  in the present as the militia is  escorting miles to their base they come  across a bridge suddenly an explosion  occurs and while everyone is startled  Nora and Charlie arrive and rescue miles  before leaving they set off another  explosion to ensure that they will not  be pursued elsewhere Maggie and Aaron  who are on a mission to find Grace  finally reach her house but find it  abandoned Aaron who is revealed to be a  former Google employee knows a great  deal about computers so when he heads to  the basement he notices Grace's computer  and immediately finds out that it was  recently built indicating that the place  had electricity however when he analyzes  the machine for hours he gets no clues  tired Aaron goes upstairs and shares his  disappointment with Maggie just then his  pendant starts glowing and some nearby  headphones start blasting a song the  episode ends as Maggie's iPhone also  comes to life because of which she sees  her children after years to see what  happens next watch the second part in  series recapped
 

